1
00:00:00.401 --> 00:00:03.168
Unit four. Nutrition Science!

2
00:00:04.139 --> 00:00:07.566
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.616 --> 00:00:10.720
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:14.336
Today we learn about Nutrition Science. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.704 --> 00:00:19.504
Macronutrient. Say it with me. Macronutrient!

6
00:00:23.017 --> 00:00:26.917
Micronutrient. Say it with me. Micronutrient!

7
00:00:30.443 --> 00:00:33.843
Metabolism. Say it with me. Metabolism!

8
00:00:37.366 --> 00:00:40.799
Digestion. Say it with me. Digestion!

9
00:00:44.292 --> 00:00:48.075
Balanced meal. Say it with me. Balanced meal!

10
00:00:51.514 --> 00:00:55.064
Food label. Say it with me. Food label!

11
00:00:58.549 --> 00:01:02.549
Portion size. Say it with me. Portion size!

12
00:01:06.091 --> 00:01:09.941
Nutrient timing. Say it with me. Nutrient timing!

13
00:01:13.401 --> 00:01:25.848
A macronutrient like protein and a micronutrient like vitamin C both matter for metabolism and digestion. Reading a food label helps me choose a balanced meal with the right portion size. Nutrient timing can also affect energy levels.

14
00:01:25.898 --> 00:01:28.606
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:30.012 --> 00:01:35.246
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:35.296 --> 00:01:36.446
Metabolism!

17
00:01:37.386 --> 00:01:42.353
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.403 --> 00:01:43.587
Portion size!

19
00:01:44.817 --> 00:01:51.635
Did you know? Your body actually burns calories just digesting food - this is called the thermic effect of food.

20
00:01:51.685 --> 00:01:53.600
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:54.287 --> 00:02:02.341
Think and answer. What did you learn from reading a nutrition label recently?

22
